WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.602
-It's nice to
have you here saying

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.904
you're optimistic, because
I feel, more often than not,

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.973
you show up with some
pessimism,

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.741
pessimism that has been founded.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:12.478
You -- you did predict that
Donald Trump would win.

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:15.681
And --
-Bad news, I know.

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.651
-And now, are you worried?
Are you worried about --

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.086
'Cause we saw some
very long voting lines

00:00:21.086 --> 00:00:24.290
in Georgia yesterday.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.359
How are you feeling,
not just about the outcome

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:31.697
of the election, but the ability
to have an election?

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:34.367
-I'm very worried about this.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.369
We all need to be
very worried about this.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:39.038
Donald Trump -- again,
I'm, I think,

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:42.041
one of the few people
on the left

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:44.510
that I take him
very seriously.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:48.781
When he says something,
I actually believe him.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:54.153
And him putting up this
triple fence wall,

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:56.689
first the big fence,
then the hard fence,

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.191
then the cement blocks came.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.760
I mean, this guy really has
a wall fetish clearly now.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.428
-Yeah, he likes walls.
He likes walls a lot.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.096
-He couldn't build one down
on the Mexican border,

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:06.299
so he's going to build it
around the house he lives in.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.801
And like a lot of rich people,
though,

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.770
with their gated communities,
he's thinking,

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.139
"You know, I'm living here
in a majority-black city.

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.640
Where's my gated community?"

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.677
So he puts up his gated
community around himself.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.813
But I really think -- you know,
we make jokes about this.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.784
But I think this is a dry run
to the fall.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:28.220
I'm going to just say this.
I have no inside information.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.890
Eric and Don Jr.
do not confide in me.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:35.127
But I do believe that
he's now read the polls.

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:37.730
He sees the data.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.033
He's probably going to lose.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.467
He knows it.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.303
And so now he's got to
come up with something.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:47.774
And the something will be him
trying to postpone the election.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:54.213
And if we get the second wave
of the pandemic in the fall

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:57.049
where if it's like the second
wave of the flu of 1918,

00:01:57.049 --> 00:02:00.353
the second wave killed twice as
many people as the first wave.

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.688
So we could have
an awful situation.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:05.825
And it will make sort of
kind of sense

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:07.793
to just enough people
that, "Yeah,

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:09.662
we really probably shouldn't
have the election.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:12.498
Let's postpone it."

00:02:12.498 --> 00:02:15.067
But in Trump's mind, and the way
people like Trump think is,

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.936
once you postpone something,
it's gone.

00:02:17.936 --> 00:02:20.473
-Right.
-We can't let that happen

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.941
no matter how bad it is.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:23.576
That's why they're trying to --
the Republicans are trying

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.911
to stop the mail-in voting.

00:02:25.911 --> 00:02:28.080
Uh, the --

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.716
We've seen the story
in Iowa where

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:34.720
the Republican Secretary of
State, the head of elections,

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.058
did -- they did mail out things
to everybody in Iowa.

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.760
-Ballots.
-Not a ballot.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.528
You got a form.
-Oh, right.

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:43.896
-And you could send
the form back in.

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:46.966
And so they had their largest
turnout ever in a primary

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.934
last week in Iowa.

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:52.405
And so all the Republicans
in Iowa are now ganging up

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:55.174
on the Republican
in charge of elections,

00:02:55.174 --> 00:02:57.609
saying, "This has got to stop.
We can't do this in November."

00:02:57.609 --> 00:02:59.044
'Cause as Trump, again --

00:02:59.044 --> 00:03:00.880
honest -- this is
the honest Trump --

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.551
said a few weeks ago
something to the effect of --

00:03:04.551 --> 00:03:06.052
I'm not going to do
my Trump voice.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.653
We already --
-Thank you. Thank you.

00:03:07.653 --> 00:03:08.988
It's like, kind of,
this is my show,

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.957
my, you know, yeah --
-It's your --

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:13.926
it's your -- yes.
-Thank you.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:16.762
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:22.835
-He said, um, that if we just
let everybody vote,

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:25.804
if we make it easy
for everybody to vote,

00:03:25.804 --> 00:03:27.974
that's the end
of the Republican Party.

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:30.109
They're not --
"That's the end of me."

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:32.044
He actually said that.
And I thought,

00:03:32.044 --> 00:03:34.247
yes, that's right.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.848
Because the majority
of Americans

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:37.850
believe in climate change.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.918
The majority of Americans
believe women should be

00:03:39.918 --> 00:03:41.187
paid the same as men.

00:03:41.187 --> 00:03:43.322
The majority of Americans
on, and on, and on,

00:03:43.322 --> 00:03:44.557
Healthcare for all.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:47.727
That's who we are as a people.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.828
And we don't want
the Republicans,

00:03:49.828 --> 00:03:52.531
or his kind of Republican,
anymore.

00:03:52.531 --> 00:03:53.966
They got the message.

00:03:53.966 --> 00:03:55.434
Now they got to fix
the election.

00:03:55.434 --> 00:03:56.869
They got to rig it.

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:59.305
They've got to wire
this thing up

00:03:59.305 --> 00:04:04.410
so that as few people
as possible vote.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.646
So, I think we all need to have
a discussion about this

00:04:07.646 --> 00:04:10.116
and right now,
because in order to change

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:11.985
how we're going to vote
on November 3rd,

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:14.420
that's got to be happening
right now.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.288
And it's going to have to happen
in the states.

00:04:16.288 --> 00:04:19.224
-I hope people hear
that message.

00:04:19.224 --> 00:04:23.462
I do -- would love for you to
come on again as we get closer,

00:04:23.462 --> 00:04:26.498
so that we can get what has
so far been very accurate

00:04:26.498 --> 00:04:28.100
predictions from you.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.334
So, thank you so much, Michael.

00:04:29.334 --> 00:04:30.636
It's always great
talking to you.

00:04:30.636 --> 00:04:32.004
-Thank you for having me, Seth.

00:04:32.004 --> 00:04:34.507
Thank you, it's been great
watching your show.

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:38.477
And actually the quarantine,

00:04:38.477 --> 00:04:41.814
I'm in day, like, 93.
-Yeah.

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:44.950
-And I have learned
some great things.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.154
For instance, I would do
really well under house arrest.

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:50.656
-You think you'd crush it?
-Yes.

00:04:50.656 --> 00:04:52.624
I'm never going to be
afraid of that again.

00:04:52.624 --> 00:04:53.993
But let's get rid of Trump

00:04:53.993 --> 00:04:56.862
so that people like me
are not under house arrest.

00:04:56.862 --> 00:04:58.264
Just saying.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:58.264 --> 00:04:59.766
Sounds like a deal.
Thanks, Michael.

